      "h": 3,
      "html": "<div>Every note lives on one big, infinite grid. Cards <i>*snap</i> into place and <u>~reflow</u> as you move them around, no more overlapping notes.</div><ol><li>Add a card</li><ul class=\"checklist\"><li data-checked=\"false\"><span class=\"checklist-marker\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Press T for text, C for code, M for Image, S for Spreadsheet, L for link, F for file and K for shortcut</li><li data-checked=\"false\"><span class=\"checklist-marker\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Move it around ~ooo~</li></ul><li>Make it yours!</li><ul class=\"checklist\"><li data-checked=\"false\"><span class=\"checklist-marker\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Try a new font</li><li data-checked=\"false\"><span class=\"checklist-marker\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Switch between light and dark modes</li><li data-checked=\"false\"><span class=\"checklist-marker\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Pick an emoji to set the mood for your canvas</li><li data-checked=\"false\"><span class=\"checklist-marker\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Change the accent color of a card</li></ul></ol>",
